# §38.2 storage proof generated artifacts
proof_report.json
proof_report.md

# §38.5 progressive-interview A/B proof generated artifacts (mirrors §38.2).
# The always-green CLI (`dra-progressive-interview`) emits these at the repo
# root when `write=True`. A deterministic, reviewable ledger summary is
# committed under progressive_interview/ instead (mirrors bake-off/ — see
# .gitignore lines 50-57 for the same committed-not-ignored pattern).
progressive_interview_report.json
progressive_interview_report.md

# §38.6 downstream-utility proof generated artifacts (mirrors §38.5).
# The always-green CLI (`dra-downstream-utility-proof`) emits a per-run
# `results.json` / `results.md` at the repo root when `--report-path` is left
# at its default. The diff-stable deterministic ledger is committed under
# downstream_utility/ instead (same committed-not-ignored pattern as
# progressive_interview/ and bake-off/). Only the root-level runtime copy is
# gitignored; /results.json matches the repo root only, not the folder ledger.
/results.json
/results.md

# §38.1 control-plane bake-off prototype (dra#37) — NON-CANONICAL.
# The hand-written deliverables (workflow, variants, results ledger, tests)
# ARE committed so they survive a workspace reset and are reviewable at the
# branch checkout. Only the heavy regenerable DeerFlow clone + runtime
# artifacts are gitignored. The dra wheel is unaffected: packaging uses
# `[tool.setuptools.packages.find] where = ["src"]`, so nothing outside src/
# is packaged (verified by the wheel smoke-check). See bake-off/README.md.
bake-off/_corpus/
bake-off/__pycache__/
bake-off/**/__pycache__/
bake-off/.pytest_cache/
# Vendored DeerFlow 2 clone — regenerable, gitignored (heavy).
bake-off/variant_c_deerflow/deerflow/
